<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Tyndall to make announcement Thurs.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Tyndall to make announcement Thurs.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Funds manager Tyndall Australia Ltd said on Wednesday it would hold a news conference on Thursday to announce details on its future strategy.</p>
<p>Tyndall said on a statement to the Australian Stock Exchange on Tuesday it was in negotiations about the possibility of making a takeover. Asked if the company would be making a takeover announcement on Thursday, a Tyndall spokesman told Reuters: &quot;Let's just say its about new business opportunities.&quot;</p>
<p>Tyndall is about 52 percent owned by Sir Ron Brierley's Guinness Peat Group Plc.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
